    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d491">

                <pb facs="0523" n="489" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg489"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-20"><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>What result in Hernsheim Brothers case? No apparent reason why tobacco should not
                    be instantly released. Have urged early appointment of Secretary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
